{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Do not answer a fool</b> — when he curses you." "<b>Lest you equal him</b> — like תדמה. But answer him with words of wisdom against his folly, and inform him of his stupidity, so that he not be wise in his own eyes."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:47.070674017Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}